{
  "name": "Guacamole and Fresh Salsa for Tacos",
  "servings": 4,
  "instructions": "Mash the avocados with a fork, leaving a few chunks. Stir in the lime juice, the onion, the coriander and the salt. Press a sheet of cling film onto the surface.\nFor the salsa, mix the tomatoes, the onion, the lime zest and juice and the oil in a bowl. Let it stand for at least 15 minutes so the flavours come together.\nWarm the tortillas in a dry pan, fill them with your favourite filling and top with a spoonful of each.",
